        </SPEC-OBJECT>
        <SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_72c51bc7-a171-4cdf-bf5d-d6b2a68fce9d" LAST-CHANGE="2026-04-23T13:50:56.810+02:00">
          <VALUES>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div><xhtml:p><xhtml:span style="text-decoration:underline;">Hinweise zur KSU Klassifizierung:<xhtml:br/></xhtml:span>Die KSU Klassifizierungen sind gemäß ORL24 Aufbewahrung von Unterlagen (Anlage &quot;Klassifizierungssystematik für Unterlagen (KSU)&quot;) festzulegen:</xhtml:p><xhtml:ul style="margin-left:42px;">
                    <xhtml:li> Temporäre Arbeitsunterlagen / Ausleitungen aus RM-Tool: <xhtml:b><xhtml:i>&quot;Initialklasse&quot; KSU 0.1</xhtml:i></xhtml:b></xhtml:li>
                    <xhtml:li> Alle freigegebenen Lastenheftstände: <xhtml:b><xhtml:i>&quot;Produktiventwicklungsunterlagen&quot; KSU 5.1</xhtml:i></xhtml:b></xhtml:li>
                  </xhtml:ul><xhtml:p><xhtml:b>Achtung: in AVW muss das Dokument vor Freigabe den Status KSU 5.1 haben!</xhtml:b></xhtml:p><xhtml:ul style="margin-left:42px;">
                    <xhtml:li><xhtml:b><xhtml:i> </xhtml:i></xhtml:b>Der finale Lastenheftstand, welcher die Bauteilanforderungen für das Serienprodukt beschreibt:  <xhtml:b><xhtml:i>&quot;Freigaben/dokumentationspflichtige Unterlagen für das Serien-/Endprodukt&quot; KSU 5.3</xhtml:i></xhtml:b></xhtml:li>
                  </xhtml:ul></xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250152">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div><xhtml:p><xhtml:span style="text-decoration:underline;">Notes on the Classification System for Documents (CSD):<xhtml:br/></xhtml:span>The CSD categories must be defined as per the Organizational Guideline ORL24 &quot;Retention of Documents&quot; (annex &quot;Classification System for Documents (CSD)&quot;).</xhtml:p><xhtml:ul style="margin-left:42px;">
                    <xhtml:li> Temporary working documents / exports from RM tool: <xhtml:b><xhtml:i>&quot;Initial category&quot; CSD 0.1</xhtml:i></xhtml:b></xhtml:li>
                    <xhtml:li> All released Performance Specification versions: <xhtml:b><xhtml:i>&quot;Product development documents&quot; CSD 5.1</xhtml:i></xhtml:b></xhtml:li>
                  </xhtml:ul><xhtml:p><xhtml:b>Important note: In AVW, the document must have CSD 5.1 before it can be released!</xhtml:b></xhtml:p><xhtml:ul style="margin-left:42px;">
                    <xhtml:li><xhtml:b><xhtml:i/></xhtml:b>The final Performance Specification version that specifies the part requirements for the series production product: <xhtml:b><xhtml:i>&quot;Releases and mandatory documentation for series and end products&quot; CSD 5.3</xhtml:i></xhtml:b></xhtml:li>
                  </xhtml:ul></xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>_17253547-16da-4ecf-8e8e-c9d6d30d7058</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_41de5ff4-58d1-4ccd-8711-cae0a7687f8f</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_88b38d26-9797-4fc4-93da-1f601ec9cb1d</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div><xhtml:p style="">OK</xhtml:p></xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
          </VALUES>
          <TYPE>
            <SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
          </TYPE>
        </SPEC-OBJECT>
        <SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_8c5b6341-16de-4e0f-ab80-442a1cfd7b9a" LAST-CHANGE="2025-05-15T15:04:28.000+02:00">
          <VALUES>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div><xhtml:p>Bei einer Ausleitung des Dokumentes in Word oder Excel, ist die KSU-Klassifizierung selbstständig durch den Autor in der Fußzeile des Word- bzw. Excel-Dokumentes anzupassen.</xhtml:p></xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250155">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div><xhtml:p>When exporting the document to Word or Excel, the author must independently adapt the CSD category in the footer of the Word or Excel document.</xhtml:p></xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>_1472f3dc-289e-4d81-a47b-64c0ad1dc2f6</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_41de5ff4-58d1-4ccd-8711-cae0a7687f8f</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_88b38d26-9797-4fc4-93da-1f601ec9cb1d</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div><xhtml:p style=""><xhtml:span style="text-decoration: underline;">to be clarified</xhtml:span></xhtml:p></xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
          </VALUES>
          <TYPE>
            <SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>_6071edb2-6898-4ffb-931b-eb6f7075b7cd</SPEC-OBJECT-TYPE-REF>
          </TYPE>
        </SPEC-OBJECT>
        <SPEC-OBJECT IDENTIFIER="_c942e1b6-0aa8-4a71-be23-993ff87ca214" LAST-CHANGE="2026-04-23T13:52:10.389+02:00">
          <VALUES>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_f75c0005-55e9-47ec-9a84-c6457da68612</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div>Arbeitsstände dieses Dokuments sind bei Ausleitungen mit KSU 0.1 (max. 2 Jahre ab Erstellung) zu klassifizieren. Die Klassifizierung erfolgt gemäß ORL24 &quot;Aufbewahrung von Unterlagen&quot;.</xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
              <VALUES>
                <ENUM-VALUE-REF>_aaa1ba64-f928-4220-80d4-9801308ea8ff</ENUM-VALUE-REF>
              </VALUES>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>_61dd5914-3a3d-4e22-9ece-95dc62c61fde</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-ENUMERATION-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-ENUMERATION>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER THE-VALUE="19250157">
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>_dd51195c-820f-4a8e-9dbd-9e4be23793cb</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-INTEGER-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-INTEGER>
            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <DEFINITION>
                <ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_b988e6c6-e742-4101-8e95-8a2905a50c8e</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>
              </DEFINITION>
              <THE-VALUE>
                <xhtml:div><xhtml:p>When exporting working versions of this document, these versions must be classified with CSD 0.1 (max. 2 years from creation). Classification is based on ORL24 &quot;Retention of Documents.&quot;</xhtml:p></xhtml:div>
              </THE-VALUE>
            </ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
